                <pb facs="0823" n="809" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v1/pg809"/>

                <head><seg type="margin">[102]</seg> *<hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pierrepont,
                        district attorney, to Mr. Fish, Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 15,
                        1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamilton Fish</hi>:</p>
                <p>The commission of the President and your orders have been received. Will be
                    promptly executed. Present difficulty, as marshal advised, is in finding the
                    ship. Every means will be taken.</p>
                <p>Yours, respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>EDWARDS PIERREPONT,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United
                            States-Attorney.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
